{
    "title": "Spades: Classic Card Game",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfb4Do you enjoy classic card games? If so, you'll love Spades: Classic Card Game. This is a free trickster card game, similar to Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, and Pinochle, which thoroughly tests players' strategic and memory skills, effectively training your brain. Spades's rules are simple and easy to understand, but mastering them requires time and practice. As you get deeper into this free casual game, you can unlock new challenges and rewards, ensuring every play is filled with freshness.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb4In Spades, challenge yourself with strategic gameplay by bidding the right number of tricks and skillfully playing your cards, which are key to victory. Engage in funny battles against intelligent AI opponents, whether in online or offline mode, each opponent has a unique gaming style. Hone your skills, predict your opponents' card plays, and claim victory in this free casual card game!\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51How to play?\ud83d\udc51\r\n- Spades has a standard deck of 52 playing poker cards, excluding the Jokers.\r\n- Each player will be dealt 13 cards, with the card ranks ranging from 2 (the lowest) to A (the highest), and the spades will always be the trump cards.\r\n- Bid the number of tricks you think you will finally take.\r\n-You can choose any card to play in each round of Spades, but it must be the same suit as the lead player's card.\r\n- If a player cannot play a card of the same suit as the lead player's card, they can \"discard\" instead.\r\n- Who plays the highest card in each round wins the trick.\r\n- If someone plays a spade, then the rank of the spades determines the winner of the trick.\r\n- When all 13 tricks have been played, this round ends.\r\n- Reach the predetermined score to win!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80Spades features\ud83d\ude80\r\n\r\nEasy to pick up:\r\nCompared to other free trickster card games, Spades has clearer rules, allowing new players to quickly grasp this casual game and participate, making it friendly for players of all ages.\r\n\r\nOffline gameplay:\r\nWhether online or offline, Spades is perfect for single players who want to enjoy casual trickster card games anytime, anywhere. With its strategic gameplay, it is especially suited for training your brain.\r\n\r\nMultiple modes:\r\nSpades offer various game modes, including single player mode and partner mode. Each mode has its own set of rules and challenges, suitable for both competitive and casual gaming styles.\r\n\r\nDaily rewards:\r\nPlayers can earn bonuses and prizes by completing daily missions in this free trickster card game. The rewards include coins and exclusive game content.\r\n\r\nChallenging AI:\r\nSpades have intelligent AI opponents that can work offline, providing a challenging experience for tricksters of all skill levels. Whether you're a casual player or a pro, the AI will help you improve your gameplay, making this free trickster card game a great way to train your brain.\r\n\r\nSmooth Graphics: \r\nSpades has stunning graphics and animations, that bring the trickster card game to life. For players who enjoy games like Hearts, Gin Rummy, Rummy, Pinochle, Poker, and Canasta, this free casual game is the perfect choice.\r\n\r\nUndo your last move at any time:\r\nNow in Spades, you can retract your previous actions at any time, and using it strategically will help you win this classic trickster card game more easily.\r\n\r\n58 levels:\r\nThis casual card game offers different levels, ranging from rookie to billionaire, winning matches in higher-level Spades will yield more abundant rewards.\r\n\r\nFree game: \r\nSpades is free, allowing you to enjoy hours of this casual trickster card game anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaePlayers who enjoy classic card games such as Hearts, Rummy, Bridge, and Poker will have a great time playing this free casual game! With intuitive gameplay and strategic depth, Spades is easy to pick up and play at your own pace. Challenge yourself against clever AI opponents as you refine your skills and tactics in this trickster card game. Install Spades now, improve your card skills through online or offline games, and enjoy the fun of training your brain!",
